<tag>
<description><![CDATA[The AccordionPane is a component used by accordion as a container to display contents.<p>For more information, see the <a href="http://wiki.icefaces.org/display/ICE/AccordionPane">AccordionPane Wiki Documentation</a>.]]></description>
